---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Public Liability Insurance in Cambodia"
  description="A safeguard in case you're held accountable for causing personal injury to someone else or damaging their property — included in all our business insurance packages."
  quoteHref="#form"
>
  <!-- Page hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="page-hero-grid">
        <div class="page-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
            <a href="/">Home</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <a href="/general-insurance-in-cambodia/">General Insurance</a>
            <span aria-hidden="true">/</span>
            <span>Public Liability</span>
          </nav>
          <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">General Insurance</p>
          <h1>Public Liability Insurance in Cambodia</h1>
          <p class="hero-lead">A safeguard in case you're held accountable for causing personal injury to someone else or damaging their property — a crucial protection included in all our business insurance packages.</p>
          <div class="hero-ctas">
            <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
            <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">Call us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-hero-visual">
          <img src="/assets/liability-insurance.webp" alt="Woman carefully walking down stairs holding the handrail" width="600" height="400" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Article -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container article-grid">
      <div class="article-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">Public Liability</p>
        <h2>Protection when you're held responsible</h2>
        <p>Public Liability insurance serves as a safeguard in case you are held accountable for causing personal injury to someone else or damaging their property. It stands out as a crucial protection included in all our business insurance packages, underscoring its significance.</p>
        <h3>Why Public Liability Insurance is Vital for Your Business</h3>
        <p>Operating a business comes with inherent risks, from customer accidents on your premises to potential damages caused by your products or services. Public Liability Insurance is your first line of defense, offering protection that covers legal fees, compensation claims, and medical costs, should you be found liable for injury or property damage. This cover is indispensable, whether you own a retail store, a restaurant, an office, or operate in the construction sector. It's not just about compliance — it's about ensuring the longevity and security of your business.</p>
        <a href="#form" class="btn btn-gold">Get a Quote</a>
      </div>

      <aside class="peril-card">
        <h3>What's covered</h3>
        <ul class="peril-list">
          <li>Legal fees</li>
          <li>Compensation claims</li>
          <li>Medical costs</li>
          <li>Third-party property damage</li>
          <li>Third-party bodily injury</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Who needs it -->
  <section class="section section-cream">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who needs it</p>
      <h2>Protection for every business</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">Whether you welcome customers, serve guests, or manage a job site, Public Liability is indispensable to your operations.</p>

      <div class="cov-grid cov-grid-4">
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 21V8l8-5 8 5v13M9 21v-6h6v6M4 21h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Retail</span>
          <h3>Retail Stores</h3>
          <p>Protection against customer slips, trips, and accidents on your premises.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 11h16v9a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H5a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-9Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M8 11V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Hospitality</span>
          <h3>Restaurants</h3>
          <p>Cover guest injuries and property damage claims from dining incidents.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"></rect><path d="M8 8h2M8 12h2M8 16h2M14 8h2M14 12h2M14 16h2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Corporate</span>
          <h3>Offices</h3>
          <p>Safeguard against visitor injuries and third-party property damage.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
        <article class="cov-card">
          <span class="cov-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 21h18M5 21V10l4-2v13M13 21V6l4-2v17M9 13h0M9 17h0" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg></span>
          <span class="cov-tag">Construction</span>
          <h3>Construction Sites</h3>
          <p>Essential cover for site risks, from equipment damage to public injury.</p>
          <a href="#form" class="link-arrow">Get a Quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Contact / Quote -->
  <section class="section quote-section" id="form">
    <div class="container quote-grid">
      <div class="quote-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Get a quote</p>
        <h2>Your free Public Liability quote within 24 hours</h2>
        <p class="section-lead section-lead-light">Tell us about your business. Compare offers from multiple insurers with clear, professional advice.</p>
        <ul class="check-list check-list-light">
          <li>We compare 15+ insurers to get you the best rate</li>
          <li>Available in French and English</li>
          <li>Officially licensed and registered in Cambodia</li>
          <li>Fully confidential — your request is never spammed</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="quote-cta-row">
          <a href="https://t.me/AGCambodia" class="btn btn-outline-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M21 4 3 11l6 2m12-9-4 16-8-6m0 0 3-2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Telegram
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+85523998018" class="btn btn-outline-light">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M6.6 10.8c1.4 2.8 3.8 5.2 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1C10.9 21 3 13.1 3 3.5c0-.6.4-1 1-1H7.7c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.4 0 .8-.2 1L6.6 10.8Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></svg>
            Call us
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="quote-form-card">
        <p class="quote-form-title">Company &amp; get covered</p>
        <p class="quote-form-sub">Tell us a bit about your business and a broker will call you back within 24 hours.</p>

        <div class="quote-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Insurance type">
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Health Insurance</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Vehicle</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Property</button>
          <button type="button" class="quote-tab is-active" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Other</button>
        </div>

        <form id="quote-form" novalidate>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="firstName">First name *</label>
              <input id="firstName" name="firstName" type="text" required autocomplete="given-name" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="lastName">Last name *</label>
              <input id="lastName" name="lastName" type="text" required autocomplete="family-name" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-row">
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="email">Email *</label>
              <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required autocomplete="email" />
            </div>
            <div class="form-field">
              <label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp *</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" required autocomplete="tel" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="form-field">
            <label for="message">Message</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4"></textarea>
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-gold btn-block">Request my free quote <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <p class="form-note">
            <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="9" rx="1.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></rect><path d="M8 11V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg>
            Your information is 100% confidential
          </p>
          <p class="form-status" id="form-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
